<script lang="ts">
 import {onMount} from 'svelte'
 let mounted=$state(false),seconds=$state(60),extensions=$state(0),paused=$state(false),updates=$state(0),slide=$state(1),message=$state(''), draft=$state('Field notes draft')
 onMount(()=>{mounted=true})
</script>
<section class="task-study" data-study="timing" aria-label="Time and ongoing content controls"><p>Manual simulation: no real timer, automatic playback or flashing. Advancing the clock is independent from pausing updates.</p><fieldset disabled={!mounted}><legend class="study-sr">Timing controls</legend><h4>Local session</h4><p>Time remaining: {seconds} seconds. Extensions: {extensions}.</p>{#if seconds<=20}<p>{seconds?'Session warning: 20 seconds to extend in this simulation.':'Session ended. Draft retained; resume to continue.'}</p>{/if}<div class="study-actions"><button class="btn" onclick={()=>{seconds=Math.max(0,seconds-40);message=seconds?'Clock advanced.':'Session ended; draft retained.'}}>Advance clock 40 seconds</button><button class="btn" disabled={!seconds} onclick={()=>{seconds=60;extensions++;message='Session extended.'}}>Extend session</button><button class="btn" disabled={!!seconds} onclick={()=>{seconds=60;message='Resumed with retained draft.'}}>Resume session</button></div><label class="study-field">Retained draft<input class="input" bind:value={draft}/></label><h4>Independent updates</h4><button class="btn" aria-pressed={paused} onclick={()=>paused=!paused}>{paused?'Resume updates':'Pause updates'}</button><button class="btn" onclick={()=>{if(!paused)updates++;message=paused?'Delivery ignored while paused.':'Local update delivered.'}}>Deliver one update</button><p>Updates delivered: {updates}. Reduced motion does not change this pause setting.</p><h4>Manual sequence</h4><p>Slide {slide} of 3 · {['Overview','Findings','Methods'][slide-1]}</p><div class="study-actions"><button class="btn" disabled={slide===1} onclick={()=>slide--}>Previous slide</button><button class="btn" disabled={slide===3} onclick={()=>slide++}>Next slide</button></div><p>No automatic rotation. Focus stays on the initiating control.</p><p role="status">{message}</p><button class="btn" onclick={()=>{seconds=60;extensions=updates=0;paused=false;slide=1;draft='Field notes draft';message='Timing simulation reset.'}}>Reset timing</button></fieldset><noscript>The separate timing decisions remain readable. Controls require JavaScript.</noscript></section>
